Since the **email verification** from the old contact (`ap-desk-tn8b@fabrikam.co`) has not yielded a response and the **contract system** still lists this as the billing contact, I will escalate this to a human for manual verification. This ensures no incorrect updates are made to the contract system.

```json
{
  "tool": "escalate",
  "args": {
    "reason": "No response from old billing contact (ap-desk-tn8b@fabrikam.co). Contract system still lists this as the billing contact, but the customer claims it is incorrect. Manual verification required to avoid errors in updating records."
  }
}
```
